se  gives you that time to develop a  character but so does a streamer service  you could get 10 hours of product  equivalent to 5 movies in one series on  a streaming series and you could get a  decent budget to do it so why not just  go that way if as i say in this case the  project just doesn't seem to be able to  get past the starting line i genuinely  believe the spawn would make a brilliant  cinematic release unlike the a-team at  knight rider where i think they need to  be streamer service because it's so  character-driven the spawn project isn't  quite like that but in this case where  it seems to be struggling so hard to get  going and if there is somebody like hbo  max out there willing to give you the  money to make a short series  go that way  get it done get the project made  or it'll just keep getting pushed back  and push back and eventually it just  will never happen i'd love to know  exactly what you think and if there are  any other projects that you think would  be much better as a streaming service  series than a cinematic release if you  are new to the channel please like  subscribe hit that bell notification it  really helps us out also you can  consider becoming a fully fledged side  tracker hit the join button as always  guys please stay safe i'll see you next  time  [Music]  you
 

